  {
   "id": "norco-129097@post-2022-04-01",
   "gameId": "norco-129097",
   "displayName": "NORCO REVIEWS & PATCH NOTES",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-04-01T18:25:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "NORCO released last week and we've been overwhelmed by the support.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We were particularly touched by these insightful reviews from PC Gamer & Kotaku (which calls the game a \"Mesmerizing Head-fuck\"); this hilarious stream from TiraLyra; this excellent fanart from twitter and then so many thoughtful, insightful Steam reviews, more than we can point to in this post, but here are a couple...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This one articulates the themes of the game well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So does this one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Even a couple of the negative ones were extremely insightful and generous. So thank you to everyone for being courteous, thoughtful, and supportive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The reviews help a lot, as do the bug reports. We take all of this into consideration. We pushed our first patch out today with several bug fixes, and next week we're aiming to deploy the French, German, Spanish, Russian, and Brazilian-Portuguese language versions – I'll confirm the exact date soon, but the languages are coming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can check on the latest version patch notes here, and submit any bugs you find here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "'Thank you' seems insufficient here but it's the best I got. So thank you, a lot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With love, Y.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
